<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111827;">
  <h2 style="margin-top: 0; font-size: 20px;">
    Article Status Updated
  </h2>

  <p>Dear {{authorName}},</p>

  <p>
    Your article
    <strong>{{articleTitle}}</strong>
    has been
    <strong style="text-transform: capitalize;">{{statusLabel}}</strong>
    by an administrator on <strong>LawRoute</strong>.
  </p>

  <p>
    You can log in to your dashboard to review the status and see more
    details about your article.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a
      href="{{loginUrl}}"
      style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 14px;background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;"
    >Go to LawRoute</a>
  </p>

  <p style="color:#6b7280;margin-top:18px;">
    Best regards,<br />
    The LawRoute Team
  </p>
</div>
